<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia cuts internal price of coffee 9.1 percent.</title>
<headline>Colombia cuts internal price of coffee 9.1 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's National Coffee Growers' Federation said it had cut the internal price of a 125- kg load of coffee by 9.1 percent Friday to 325,625 pesos.</p>
<p>The new price, which is revised on a sliding scale basis each week, was based on an average price of $1.94 per pound in international markets, the federation said. ((--Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
